a drink or coffee sometime.

561
00:38:12.580 --> 00:38:13.848
Sounds good.

562
00:38:15.350 --> 00:38:16.852
I would like that.

563
00:38:34.870 --> 00:38:36.268
You look like shit.

564
00:38:36.270 --> 00:38:37.640
Oh, ditto.

565
00:38:43.678 --> 00:38:46.347
