567
00:38:52.020 --> 00:38:53.719
It's Marlene.

568
00:38:53.721 --> 00:38:55.855
God, I don't know why
I bother showing you anything.

569
00:38:55.857 --> 00:38:57.226
How much did you get?

570
00:38:58.292 --> 00:38:59.692
I got $400 for two.

571
