from your seedy dealings.

578
00:39:13.709 --> 00:39:15.775
Hello, ladies.

579
00:39:15.777 --> 00:39:17.479
I resent that.

580
00:39:18.113 --> 00:39:20.480
Mmm. May I ask...

581
00:39:20.482 --> 00:39:22.616
