669
00:44:05.600 --> 00:44:09.504
Just in case,
who should we look out for?

670
00:44:10.805 --> 00:44:12.073
That one.

671
00:44:12.506 --> 00:44:13.575
The bowtie?

672
00:44:15.009 --> 00:44:17.145
